      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对我来说决胜服，就是一起实现梦想的伙伴！！\n只要一穿上就兴奋不已心动不已，能给我力量！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee3515bcf18f1d6e6ce5a060cff02eaf23e31b9099098ac7fc9b5e00ec8e7012",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
